    compiled together with the same settings.  Code includes their
    headers by subdirectory, e.g. "util/StringStorage.h", so every
    project has both core-lib and win32-lib on its include path.

    Programs linking this library must also link Ws2_32.lib and
    version.lib.  They are not merged into this library, because
